    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "文選及習作",
    "sub_ename": "CHINESE CLASSICAL PROSE AND WRITING PRACTICE",
    "describe_ch": "本課程以古典文學作品選讀為主，輔以古文寫作練習，透過對謀篇、布局、遣詞、用字等創作技巧的揣摩與演練，瞭解古代文學作品特色，提升文學鑑賞能力。",
    "describe_eh": "This course focuses on the selection and reading of classical literary works, supplemented by ancient writing exercises. Through speculation and drills on creative skills such as essay writing, layout, word selection, and word use, we can understand the characteristics of ancient literary works and enhance the ability of literary appreciation.",
